    "detailed_description": "This game is a small visual novel <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- part one of twenty-seven <br />\r\n- 20-30 minutes long.<br />\r\n- English and Japanese text <br />\r\n- some choices lead to new dialogue <br />\r\n- The game can be saved at any time <br />\r\n- An in-game log keeps track of the story <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a vast and mysterious realm, three unlikely allies - Joe, Ruffian, and Hamlet - embark on a dangerous quest that will test their courage and fortitude to the fullest. As they traverse ancient forests, treacherous rivers, and valleys of shadow, they encounter formidable challenges and discover long-forgotten mysteries that hold the fate of the world. This is the first of 27 books.",
    "about_the_game": "This game is a small visual novel <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- part one of twenty-seven <br />\r\n- 20-30 minutes long.<br />\r\n- English and Japanese text <br />\r\n- some choices lead to new dialogue <br />\r\n- The game can be saved at any time <br />\r\n- An in-game log keeps track of the story <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a vast and mysterious realm, three unlikely allies - Joe, Ruffian, and Hamlet - embark on a dangerous quest that will test their courage and fortitude to the fullest. As they traverse ancient forests, treacherous rivers, and valleys of shadow, they encounter formidable challenges and discover long-forgotten mysteries that hold the fate of the world. This is the first of 27 books.",
    "short_description": "embark on an epic journey where ancient forests, treacherous rivers, and shadowy valleys hold secrets both wondrous and perilous. Guided by destiny and bound by friendship the trio face daunting challenges and unearth forgotten mysteries As they navigate the twists and turns of their quest",
